rit of innovation within their communities and institutions while educating \nand mentoring the next generation of inventors.\u201d  As explained in his university\u2019s press release and \ndepartment\u2019s 2022 brochure about this honor, \u201cAxelbaum holds 10 patents and founded the startup \ncompany AP Material Inc., which commercialized a flame-synthesis technology to manufacture high-\npurity nanopowders.\u201d", "metadata": {"source": "PSI-10_Reports_FinalRpt_ACMEFlameDesign.pdf", "page": 104}}